{
    "title": "Logo Quiz - World Trivia Game",
    "description": "Welcome to Logo Quiz - World Trivia Game, the ultimate free logo guessing quiz trivia game in the world!\r\n\r\nWith hundreds of levels and thousands of logos and brands to guess, this game is guaranteed to keep you entertained for hours on end. The best part? It's completely free to play!\r\n\r\nDownload now and join to our millions of players around the world that already get addicted!\r\n\r\nAs you progress through Logo Quiz - World Trivia Game, you'll unlock new levels and challenges that will put your logo knowledge to the test. In 2023, the game is expected to have an even larger roster of logos to guess from, with many new brands from the worlds of entertainment, sports, and food. \r\n\r\nThis game is highly addictive and challenging, with new levels and logos being added regularly to keep you on your toes. Test your knowledge of the successful and famous and see if you have what it takes to become a true logo trivia master.\r\n\r\nIf you think you're up for an even bigger challenge, invite your friends and family to play with you and see who can guess the most logos correctly. Logo Quiz - World Trivia Game is the perfect game for a group outing or for passing the time with your loved ones. \r\n\r\nBut the fun doesn't stop there - this game also has tons of amazing features to keep you engaged and coming back for more:\r\n\r\n\u2605 Easy to play - Just tap on the logo you think is in the picture to make your guess.\r\n\u2605 Localized - Fully accesible to 6 languages\r\n\u2605 High-quality pics of logos that are challenging but not impossible to guess.\r\n\u2605 5000+ logo designs with a small size of the application!\r\n\u2605 Hints - stuck on a level? Use a hint to get a clue and keep the game moving.\r\n\u2605 In-game currency - use coins to purchase hints, lives or unlock special levels.\r\n\u2605 Offline play - no internet? No problem. This game can be played offline.\r\n\u2605 A wide range of difficulty levels, from beginner to expert, to appeal to players of all skill levels.\r\n\u2605 Detailed stats: Track your progress and see how you compare to other players.\r\n\u2605 Multiple lives: Use multiple lives to keep playing even if you make a wrong guess.\r\n\u2605 Daily Lucky Wheel: Log in every day to spin the Lucky Wheel receive special daily rewards and bonuses.\r\n\u2605 Regular updates - with new levels, logos, and features added all the time, there's always something new to discover.\r\n\r\nOne of the best things about Logo Quiz - World Trivia Game is that it's the perfect game to play no matter where you are. Whether you're stuck on a long car ride or waiting for your flight at the airport, this game will keep you entertained for hours on end. And with offline play available, you can even enjoy the game when you don't have an internet connection.\r\n\r\nBut don't just take our word for it - players around the world are already raving about Logo Quiz - World Trivia Game. From its high-quality logo designs to its wide range of difficulty levels, this game has something for everyone. In fact, it's consistently ranked as one of the top trivia games in the app store.\r\n\r\nif you're looking for even more ways to get involved, be sure to check out the game's community forums. Here, you can connect with other players, share tips and tricks, and discuss all things trivia.\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD NOW FOR FREE\r\n\r\nSo why wait? Download Logo Quiz - World Trivia Game today and start enjoying all the fun and excitement this logo trivia game has to offer. And don't forget to invite your friends to play!\r\n\r\nOverall, this game is an absolute blast to play. It's challenging and satisfying, but most of all, it's just plain fun. I can't recommend it enough!\r\n\r\nCompare your answers with your friends!\r\nChallenge them to see who knows more logos!\r\n\r\nNew logos are coming soon.\r\nCheck for the updates!\r\n\r\n* All logos shown or represented in this game are copyright and/or trademark of their respective corporations. The use of low-resolution images in this app for use of identification in an informational context qualifies as fair use under copyright law.",
